                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This dataset is functional for the use of tantalum as powder in capacitors of port-able electronic devices. It is not valid for the use as an alloying element in steel. Only primary production from tantalite / pegmatite ore is considered. Tantalum as by-product from tin production is not considered.;
CAS number: 007440-25-7; 
Formula: Ta; 
Synonyms: tantalium; 
UUID: 4188cecc-7090-3e8b-835e-0444be56680b</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
